r common-sense expectations; however, some micro-level cues could be refined for even tighter realism.\n\nOverall assessment:\n- Visual Quality: 3/5\n- Text-to-Video Alignment: 4/5\n- Physical Consistency: 3/5\n\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 3\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 3\n"
